# I would now define four top-level system objects

### `Market`

What exists/is changing.

### `Opportunity`

An evidence-backed unmet economic/technical condition.

### `Factory`

A repeatable strategy + machinery for exploiting a class of opportunities.

### `Product`

A concrete deployed experiment/business/tool produced by a factory.

And relationships:

```text
Market
  ↓ supports
Opportunity
  ↓ justifies
Factory
  ↓ produces
Product
  ↓ generates
Outcome
  ↓ updates
Market
